  "speed": 1.2,
  "lines": [
    {"line": 1, "text": "Agent 不是一次问答。", "path": "project://assets/voice/narration-7bdec16b68cd2b80.wav", "duration_s": 2.02},
    {"line": 2, "text": "它先定目标，再决定下一步。", "path": "project://assets/voice/narration-44ea89b5c7d82fde.wav", "duration_s": 2.554},
    {"line": 3, "text": "用工具拿回结果，再改计划。", "path": "project://assets/voice/narration-29d2845ea1b3a633.wav", "duration_s": 2.659},
    {"line": 4, "text": "这个循环会留下记录。", "path": "project://assets/voice/narration-d4faf447065c95af.wav", "duration_s": 1.707},
    {"line": 5, "text": "能回查，才算跑过。", "path": "project://assets/voice/narration-c581daf8c87db4b0.wav", "duration_s": 2.194},
    {"line": 6, "text": "模型不是记忆，窗口才是。", "path": "project://assets/voice/narration-3f1568b853c3b015.wav", "duration_s": 2.728},
    {"line": 7, "text": "工具要有边界，读和写分开。", "path": "project://assets/voice/narration-59284e32bdf64238.wav", "duration_s": 2.844},
    {"line": 8, "text": "失败要能重试，也要能停下。", "path": "project://assets/voice/narration-9092e58ecd7fecaf.wav", "duration_s": 2.879},
    {"line": 9, "text": "评估看结果，不看话说得顺。", "path": "project://assets/voice/narration-8db6e4bcd194cddb.wav", "duration_s": 2.589},
    {"line": 10, "text": "成本是设计的一部分。", "path": "project://assets/voice/narration-cade491dafd65763.wav", "duration_s": 1.846},
    {"line": 11, "text": "不是所有任务都值得做成 Agent。", "path": "project://assets/voice/narration-7c618ec3cf840fb6.wav", "duration_s": 2.914},
    {"line": 12, "text": "先把边界写清楚，再谈自动化。", "path": "project://assets/voice/narration-6aaa7097ffad2e43.wav", "duration_s": 2.659}
  ],
  "total_s": 29.593
